<section class="bhd-page__feature">
  <div>
    <p class="bhd-page__kicker">Daily hydration</p>
    <h2>Build the habit around access, not a magic number</h2>
    <p>Fluid comes from drinks and food, and needs change with activity, climate and health. A rigid universal daily target is usually less useful than a routine built around thirst, meals and easy access to water.</p>
    <p>Visible water, a reusable bottle and drinking with meals are simple habits that work without turning hydration into a project.</p>
  </div>
</section>

